      "slug": "slime",
      "title": "Slime",
      "client": "Wall’s",
      "category": "Launch campaign",
      "description": "Slime is a new product from Brazil that is getting traction from more markets. Slime is a trend that is still relevant for kids/teens and our products tap into those clear passion points by delivering on fruity but exciting ice cream. •Objective: Drive awareness for this new product by fully highlighting the excitement that Slime brings. In some markets where we have multiple flavors, the packaging is the same and it is a surprise for consumers which flavor they will get. Slime is not just slime. It’s a cultural phenomenon. Ever since Nickelodeon first slimed a celebrity, the legend of the slime has grown. And now, everyone can now enjoy 3 great Nickelodeon Slime ice creams. They can experience the feeling of Slime taking over, surprising them, delighting them, invigorating their tastebuds.",
